+  "packages/mcp-bridge/README.md": {
+    "$document": "<!-- Generated by scripts/docs/generate-forge-claims.ts. Do not edit; run pnpm docs:claims. -->\n# @oods/mcp-bridge\n\nHTTP transport for the native Forge server. Build the server first, then run `pnpm --filter @oods/mcp-bridge run dev` from the repository root. The extracted portable runtime also includes this bridge and its policies.\n\nThe default listener is `127.0.0.1:{{bridgePort}}`; `MCP_BRIDGE_PORT` overrides the port. `BRIDGE_TOKEN` enables the `X-Bridge-Token` header. Write-gated calls use `X-Bridge-Approval` according to policy. Endpoints are `GET /health`, `GET /tools`, `POST /run` and `/artifacts/*`; refresh `/tools` for the live enabled surface. Build revision and availability are reported by health.\n\nThe registry advertises {{auto}} tools by default and {{onDemand}} on demand ({{tools}} total). Enable on-demand entries with `MCP_TOOLSET=all` or select them with `MCP_EXTRA_TOOLS`.\n\nThe retained portable adapter E2E exercises {{portableTools}} advertised tools: {{portablePass}} results and {{portableTyped}} typed dependency limits, {{portableLimits}}. Source evidence tiers below do not imply executed proof for every tool.\n\n| Default tool / actions | Source evidence tier |\n| --- | --- |\n{{toolRowsMarkdown}}\n\n| On-demand tool | Source evidence tier |\n| --- | --- |\n{{onDemandRowsMarkdown}}\n\nRetired tools and their rationale are recorded in the generated [Tool-Specs retirement table](../../docs/mcp/Tool-Specs.md).\n\nThe extracted-bundle reference-app ledger records {{releaseCells}} cells for {{releaseApps}} across {{releaseContexts}} contexts and {{releaseFrameworks}}: {{releasePass}} pass, {{releaseTyped}} typed gaps and {{releaseEqual}} generated artifacts equal their host hashes. These bounded receipts do not imply universal application coverage.\n\nSources: [tool registry](../mcp-server/src/tools/registry.json), [tool ledger](../mcp-server/registry/tool-capability-ledger.v1.json), [release ledger](../mcp-server/registry/release-cells.v1.json). Complete contracts: [Tool-Specs](../../docs/mcp/Tool-Specs.md), [API reference](../../docs/api/README.md). Connection profiles: [Connections](../../docs/mcp/Connections.md). Extracted distribution: [portable runtime](../../docs/runtime/portable-runtime.md).\n"
